# ─── SDXL (local-only backend) ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# IMAGE_PROVIDER=gemini is the active poster backend. The SDXL path is kept on
# disk and still works (IMAGE_PROVIDER=local), but is not tracked in git.
# Consequence: a fresh clone has no sdxl_service.py — the four SDXL chunking
# tests skip themselves (see tests/test_main.py), and IMAGE_PROVIDER=local
# will not run there until the file is restored.
backend/ai/diffusion/
backend/app/services/ai/sdxl_prompt_template.md

